sdcv
------------------------------------------
StarDict Console Version

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libglib2.0_0-2.90.1-1
  libintl8-0.26-1
  libreadline8-8.3-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  zlib0-1.4-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  gettext-devel-0.26-1
  jq-1.8.1-1
  libglib2.0-devel-2.90.1-1
  libiconv-1.19-2
  libintl-devel-0.26-1
  libreadline-devel-8.3-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1
  zlib-devel-1.4-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/Dushistov/sdcv

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/Dushistov/sdcv/archive/refs/tags/v0.5.5.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack sdcv-0.5.5-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./sdcv-0.5.5-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/sdcv-0.5.5-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/sdcv-0.5.5-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

